(:id "port/squirrel/vt/text-form" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/squirreltable/vt_text_cells_test.go: TestSquirrelVtTextCells, TestSquirrelVtTextCellsNegativeControl" "internal/codegen/squirreltable/json_test.go TestSquirrelJsonAgreesWithTheCorpus, TestSquirrelJsonNegativeControl" "test/conformance/squirrel/main.nut (make conformance): json-read, json-write and json-hostile (134 rows)" "make conformance-negative-control-squirrel-walk") :tested-revision "fd4c3949defe79d1cd87363c4cd846cf23f1bfe4" :note "2026-11-09: TestSquirrelVtTextCells runs the strict text read in the pinned Squirrel interpreter via sqrun under slowtest.Gate: a plain FixedRoot value round-trips FromJson -> ToJson -> FromJson, and out-of-range, kind-mismatch, trailing-junk and fixed-root &node texts are refused whole. TestSquirrelVtTextCellsNegativeControl plants faults in a copy of runtime/json.nut (the emitted schema_table_json.nut: the damage mark removed and the variable label map dropped) and runs sqrun to require the corresponding strict-read cell to go red. Tested at fd4c3949defe79d1cd87363c4cd846cf23f1bfe4, which contains internal/codegen/squirreltable/vt_text_cells_test.go.")
(:id "port/squirrel/vt/reflection" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/squirreltable/vt_cook_cells_test.go TestSquirrelVtCookCells, TestSquirrelVtCookCellsNegativeControl" "internal/codegen/squirreltable/view_test.go TestSquirrelViewMatchesTheGoView" "internal/codegen/squirreltable/squirreltable_test.go TestSquirrelTableDescriptorsLoad") :tested-revision "dce0173745b59eeef64521ee4fc23c8a31e892a5" :note "2026-11-09: TestSquirrelVtCookCells passes the strict read (ReadStrict and FromJson: one read returns the whole value or refuses the whole load) and checks reflection on RootTableInfo (name Root, variable table, four fields, id range 1 to 100, rows a counted array bound 4). TestSquirrelVtCookCellsNegativeControl plants rangeIntMax = 99 in a copy of CookcellsTables.nut and fatals with NEGATIVE CONTROL FAILED if reflection stays green. The source gate also requires the TableInfo emitter shape. Tested at dce0173745b59eeef64521ee4fc23c8a31e892a5, which contains internal/codegen/squirreltable/vt_cook_cells_test.go.")
(:id "port/squirrel/vt/cook-open" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/squirreltable/vt_cook_cells_test.go TestSquirrelVtCookCells, TestSquirrelVtCookCellsNegativeControl" "internal/codegen/squirreltable/cook_test.go TestSquirrelCookReadMatchesTheCorpus" "test/conformance/squirrel/main.nut (make conformance): cook, cook-foreign, cook-forgery (113) and cook-reason (21)") :tested-revision "dce0173745b59eeef64521ee4fc23c8a31e892a5" :note "2026-11-09: TestSquirrelVtCookCells passes the strict read (ReadStrict and FromJson) then cook-open: a little-endian cook opens, a big-endian cook refuses foreign_order, a flipped build version refuses wrong_build_version, and a truncated buffer refuses truncated. TestSquirrelVtCookCellsNegativeControl comments out the wrong_build_version check in a copy of schema_table_cook.nut and fatals with NEGATIVE CONTROL FAILED if cook-open stays green. Tested at dce0173745b59eeef64521ee4fc23c8a31e892a5, which contains internal/codegen/squirreltable/vt_cook_cells_test.go.")
